---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const title = 'Terms and Conditions | JSON Diff Checker';
const description =
  'Terms and Conditions for using JSON Diff Checker, a free browser-based JSON comparison tool provided as-is with no warranty.';
---

<PageLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  eyebrow="Terms and conditions"
  heading="Terms and Conditions"
  updated="September 6, 2026"
>
  <h2>Acceptance of terms</h2>
  <p>
    By accessing or using jsondiffchecker.com (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms and
    Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.
  </p>

  <h2>Description of service</h2>
  <p>
    JSON Diff Checker provides a free, browser-based tool for comparing two JSON documents and viewing
    the differences between them. All processing occurs locally in your browser; the Site does not require
    an account or subscription.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of the service</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to use the Site only for lawful purposes. You are solely responsible for the content you
    paste, upload, or load into the tool, and for ensuring you have the right to use and compare that
    content.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    The Site and its tool are provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, whether
    express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a
    particular purpose, accuracy, or non-infringement. While we aim for the comparison logic to be correct,
    we do not guarantee that results will be error-free or uninterrupted.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, JSON Diff Checker and its operators shall not be liable for any
    indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use
    of, or inability to use, the Site.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The Site's design, branding, and underlying code are the property of JSON Diff Checker unless otherwise
    noted. You retain full ownership of any JSON data you process using the tool.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party references</h2>
  <p>
    The Site is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any third-party service, including
    similarly named tools such as Diffchecker.com or json-diff.com.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may revise these Terms and Conditions at any time. Continued use of the Site after changes are
    posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these Terms and Conditions can be sent to us via our <a href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a> page.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
